###Mapping
Mapping test::wistfulharbor::mapping::BerthM2M
(
  *test::wistfulharbor::domain::Berth[berth_feed]: Pure
  {
    ~src test::wistfulharbor::domain::BerthFeed
    berthId: $src.id,
    label: $src.lbl,
    slots: if($src.n < 0,
              | 0,
              | $src.n)
  }
)
